{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Floorball League 2010</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step onto the court and experience the thrill of floorball with <strong><i>Floorball League 2010</i></strong> (formerly <i>FBL</i> /\u00a0<i>Floorball League</i>), the first official 3D floorball video game, originally released in 2010. Dive into fast-paced matches with real teams from the International Floorball Federation and the Finnish Salibandyliiga.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re a seasoned player or new to the sport, <i><strong>FBL '10</strong></i> delivers engaging floorball action with dynamic arenas and multiple ways to play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real Teams and Leagues</strong> \u2013 Play with authentic teams from top international and Finnish leagues.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Game Modes</strong> \u2013 Jump into exhibition matches, league play, tournaments, shootouts, or practice in training mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Singleplayer &amp; Multiplayer</strong> \u2013 Play solo or compete with friends in local multiplayer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Accessible for Everyone</strong> \u2013 Easy-to-learn controls make it approachable for newcomers while still offering fun for fans of the sport.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relive the excitement of floorball in its early digital form, now updated as <i>Floorball League 2010</i>, and lead your team to victory!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4054680?t=1759768423","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4054680?t=1759768423","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054680/4178f0a8573a42c39eae65b5bb79a